classDiagram
direction TB
class ConfigSystem {
  <<QFrameworkCandidate>>
  LoadAndValidate()
  GetCatalog()
}
class ConfigCatalog {
  <<ReadOnlyPureData>>
  configVersion
  professions
  heroLevelStats
  enemyDefinitions
  enemyStats
  encounters
}
class ProfessionDefinition {
  professionId
  levelStatsId
  attackRange
  passiveSkillId
  professionSkillId
}
class HeroLevelStatsRow {
  levelStatsId
  level
  maxHealth
  combatAttributes
}
class EnemyDefinition {
  enemyTypeId
  attackType
  attackRange
  behaviorKind
  skillIds
}
class EnemyStatsRow {
  enemyStatsId
  enemyTypeId
  maxHealth
  combatAttributes
}
class EncounterEnemyEntry {
  pairId
  enemyTypeId
  enemyStatsId
  position
  actionInterval
  firstActionDelay
}
class EncounterDefinition {
  encounterId
  boardId
  recommendedLevel
  rewardId
}
class CombatStatBuilder {
  <<PureCSharp>>
  BuildHeroStats()
  BuildEnemyStats()
}
ConfigSystem --> ConfigCatalog : 加载与校验后提供
ConfigCatalog --> ProfessionDefinition : 按职业 ID 查询
ConfigCatalog --> EnemyDefinition : 按敌人类型查询
ConfigCatalog --> EncounterDefinition : 按关卡 ID 查询
ProfessionDefinition --> HeroLevelStatsRow : 按属性表 ID 和等级查询
EnemyDefinition --> EnemyStatsRow : 同类型可有多个数值档
EncounterDefinition "1" *-- "1..*" EncounterEnemyEntry : 固定敌人组
EncounterEnemyEntry --> EnemyStatsRow : 选择本关实际数值档
CombatStatBuilder ..> HeroLevelStatsRow : 角色入场属性
CombatStatBuilder ..> EnemyStatsRow : 敌人入场属性
note for ConfigCatalog "还包含技能、状态、物品、配方、成长经验和掉落；完整字段目录见对齐清单"
note for CombatStatBuilder "当前生命、PRD 与 CD 写入独立对局，配置本身保持只读"
